<b>API v2 MIGRATION — ROTATION AND ADDRESS-BOOK RE-VERIFICATION REQUIRED.</b>
Bitvex retires API v1 on <b>May 22</b> (7 days). Accounts with active v1 keys must rotate to v2 keys
<b>and re-verify their withdrawal address book</b> during the migration window — after migration,
v1-key accounts enter <b>trading halt</b> (open positions enter reduce-only mode; market-makers'
quotes go dark). Your account (MM-88412, market-maker tier) has <b>3 active v1 keys</b> and
<b>17 whitelisted withdrawal addresses</b> pending re-verification.
</p>

